Error [E0120]: `branch` was not moved here, so it cannot be captured by a stored lambda
  --> tests/ui/param_stored_lambda_capture_needs_copy.jet:10:17
    |
 10 |     callback :: () => branch.leaf.text.len()
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: this function can access the parameter, but it does not own the value
 Fix: copy it into an owned local first: `owned :: ~branch`
